  "description": "Community.SQLite.Activities is a free UiPath activity library for working with SQLite databases directly inside your automation workflows. No server, no setup — just a lightweight file-based database embedded in your RPA process. Includes activities for connecting, querying, inserting, bulk loading, and managing SQLite databases, with optional password encryption and flexible scope or manual connection management.",
